OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1785759510
OL,3,CFerries to start plugging in to port's
OL,4,Celectricity supply during turnarounds
OL,6,FFerries will start using taxpayer-
OL,7,Ffunded net zero infrastructure at one
OL,8,Fof the UK's busiest ports from Monday.
OL,10,FBrittany Ferries announced it will
OL,11,Fplug in its ships to an electricity
OL,12,Fsupply during turnarounds at
OL,13,FPortsmouth International Port, despite
OL,14,Fthis costing more than burning marine
OL,15,Ffuel.
OL,17,FThis follows "months of negotiation"
OL,18,Fto strike a deal with the port over
OL,19,Ffinancial terms, the operator said, as
OL,20,Fit urged the Government to incentivise
OL,21,Fthe additional expense.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/7
