FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1785759510
OL,3,CFerries to start plugging in to port's
OL,4,Celectricity supply during turnarounds
OL,6,FThe shore power system was built to
OL,7,Fenable ferries and cruise ships to
OL,8,Fswitch off their engines and plug into
OL,9,Felectricity when berthed, to cut
OL,10,Fcarbon emissions and boost air quality.
OL,12,FThe port completed its work on the
OL,13,Fproject late last year but no vessels
OL,14,Fhave been using the infrastructure,
OL,15,Fbecause electricity is several times
OL,16,Fmore expensive than marine fuel and
OL,17,Fcompleting the connection to the grid
OL,18,Fwas delayed.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1785759510
OL,3,CFerries to start plugging in to port's
OL,4,Celectricity supply during turnarounds
OL,6,FBrittany Ferries' two hybrid ships
OL,7,Fwere able to plug in from Monday
OL,8,Fmorning, which started with Guillaume
OL,9,Fde Normandie ahead of its 8am
OL,10,Fdeparture.
OL,12,FThe deal to use shore power lasts for
OL,13,Fat least the next 12 months.
OL,15,FChristophe Mathieu, chief executive of
OL,16,FBrittany Ferries, said: "This is a
OL,17,Fhuge milestone for our business, and
OL,18,Fone that we've reached thanks to a
OL,19,Fteam effort by all partners involved.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1785759510
OL,3,CFerries to start plugging in to port's
OL,4,Celectricity supply during turnarounds
OL,6,F"It means we can now realise the full
OL,7,Fpotential of the greenest vessels on
OL,8,Fthe Channel.
OL,10,F"We're better neighbours to those
OL,11,Fliving and working in Portsmouth, and
OL,12,Fwe're leading the sector on
OL,13,Fsustainability.
OL,15,F"But this doesn't come without a cost.
OL,16,FWe're urging the new Government to
OL,17,Fconsider tax breaks to offset the
OL,18,Fadditional expense of plugging-in
OL,19,Fwhile alongside.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1785759510
OL,3,CFerries to start plugging in to port's
OL,4,Celectricity supply during turnarounds
OL,6,F"Without that support, the lead taken
OL,7,Fby Portsmouth International Port and
OL,8,FBrittany Ferries is unlikely to be
OL,9,Ffollowed by others in the drive to net
OL,10,Fzero."
OL,12,FThe Sea Change project to enable ships
OL,13,Fto plug in at the port was funded by
OL,14,F#19.8 million from the Department for
OL,15,FTransport in September 2023, under the
OL,16,FConservative government, and #4.6
OL,17,Fmillion from Portsmouth City Council,
OL,18,Fwhich owns the port.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1785759510
OL,3,CFerries to start plugging in to port's
OL,4,Celectricity supply during turnarounds
OL,6,FIn February, Mike Sellers, the port's
OL,7,Fdirector, warned the system "could be
OL,8,Fa redundant asset" as it lay dormant.
OL,10,FAhead of the start of its use on
OL,11,FMonday, he said: "This is a huge
OL,12,Fmoment not only for us, but also for
OL,13,Fthe UK ports industry as a whole, as
OL,14,Fwe are now the country's first port to
OL,15,Foffer multi-berth, multi-user shore
OL,16,Fpower.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1785759510
OL,3,CFerries to start plugging in to port's
OL,4,Celectricity supply during turnarounds
OL,6,F"The clean electricity will have a big
OL,7,Fbenefit to air quality in the city,
OL,8,Fand it also helps to future-proof
OL,9,FPortsmouth Port, aligning us with
OL,10,Finternational moves towards
OL,11,Felectrification for all of our
OL,12,Fcustomers, meaning we can continue to
OL,13,Fbe profitable and provide for
OL,14,Fessential services in the city."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
